{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>El</b> — the meaning is אל תבואני רגל אנשי גאוה (\"let not the foot of the proud come upon me\"). And the meaning follows the way of ישכבנה (\"he will make him lie down\"), as if to say that they will not join him in the house of YHWH." "<b>And a hand</b> — He mentioned the foot and the hand." "<b>And the meaning of אל תנידני מדשן ביתך</b> — to another place."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {0 "The lemma אל is read as the negative particle, not the divine name."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:50.490966971Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}